    Bug 2001258 - Set correct ARIA attributes on tree-view rows. r=arschmitz

    Based on the algorithm at `XULTreeItemAccessibleBase::GroupPosition`.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D275895

diff --git a/mail/base/content/widgets/tree-view.mjs b/mail/base/content/widgets/tree-view.mjs
